{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/Wishlist_Now.png?t=1746646348\" />Daemonium is a 1-4 player online co-op psychological horror game. Demonic possessions are running rampant. Grab your equipment, join your team, and locate the source of the demonic presence. Enter the portal to the demon realm to stop the possession once and for all. Perform an exorcism and banish the entity to hell before it claims your soul.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>- &quot;One of the best rituals in any ghost hunting game&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/varietyoflocations.png?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can play in a wide variety of locations as well as a selection of demon realms which are chosen randomly each game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/combined.gif?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/4players.png?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play together with up to 4 player teams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/multiplayer.gif?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/findevidence.png?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a wide range of equipment to find evidence of paranormal activity and reveal the possessed item<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/equipment.gif?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/collect.png?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remove possessed items from the locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/possessed.gif?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/demonrealm.png?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the demon realm at your peril</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/portal.gif?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/exorcise.png?t=1746646348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform an exorcism ritual in the demon realm and banish the demon back to hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/exorcism.gif?t=1746646348\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Money Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2327140/863c063acbc846689e7e4548e45779a832d7c